// keeps the Stage 5 story untouched; an unknown host answers `NX no
// record` — the browser renders the NX card and the GET is skipped. The
// Stage 1 program lives in trace-stage1.js, the DNS phase in
// trace-stage6.js. The machine owns the trace state; the engine owns the
